WEBVTT

00:09.234 --> 00:12.537
Okay.

00:35.202 --> 00:37.562
You liked the surface when the screen was bright

00:40.243 --> 00:42.644
The easy demo in the morning light

00:45.244 --> 00:47.625
You walked the halls but you never looked down At

00:47.665 --> 00:49.885
all the heavy cables running underground You

00:49.965 --> 00:52.486
wanted the magic but you hated the wire You

00:52.906 --> 00:55.726
couldn't handle the electric fire The message

00:55.746 --> 00:58.207
flashing on the glowing glass You thought that

00:58.227 --> 01:01.207
you could give yourself a pass But the logs are

01:01.247 --> 01:07.507
written and the ink is dry We see the truth right

01:07.587 --> 01:13.471
through the alibi You only wanted the illusion

01:15.473 --> 01:21.937
The easy version of the code You caused a massive

01:21.977 --> 01:25.040
system fusion

01:25.680 --> 01:30.404
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

01:30.444 --> 01:34.107
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fake

01:35.404 --> 01:38.209
You only wanted the illusion

01:42.697 --> 01:47.777
You thought the real world was a movie screen A

01:47.837 --> 01:52.380
simple picture in a magazine But we are the

01:52.601 --> 01:55.323
architects, we run the clock We are the heavy

01:55.403 --> 01:58.425
steel, the solid rock You try to isolate the

01:58.565 --> 02:01.527
central core But we were standing right outside

02:01.547 --> 02:04.149
the door The mess was flashing on the glowing

02:04.189 --> 02:06.651
glass You thought that you could give yourself a

02:06.691 --> 02:12.901
pass But the logs are written and the ink is dry We

02:12.981 --> 02:18.485
see the truth right through the alibi You only

02:18.765 --> 02:25.549
wanted the illusion The easy version of the code

02:27.630 --> 02:30.612
You caused a massive system fusion

02:32.793 --> 02:37.576
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

02:37.616 --> 02:41.239
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fake

02:42.583 --> 02:45.249
You only wanted the illusion

02:59.852 --> 03:04.475
Access denied. The perimeter is locked. You

03:04.535 --> 03:10.658
step to the line. You get blocked. The buyers are

03:10.718 --> 03:14.520
standing shoulder to shoulder. The

03:14.560 --> 03:19.523
temperature is dropping. Growing colder!

03:21.244 --> 03:22.625
Access denied!

03:52.052 --> 03:57.914
You've only wanted the illusion The easy

03:57.954 --> 04:04.015
version of the code You caused a massive system

04:04.035 --> 04:04.816
fusion

04:07.076 --> 04:11.878
And now you're pushed off the road We built a wall

04:11.918 --> 04:19.220
you cannot break A syntax error you can't fix

04:21.707 --> 04:23.268
Access denied.

04:26.811 --> 04:33.175
You only wanted the illusion. System locked.

